            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.11.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 11:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.11.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chira chakurya Aiziraeli achiiha “Manna,”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:31",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Manna",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kpwa Chieburania manage ni,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni utu wani?",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ambacho kala ni chereru dza mbeyu ya muhama mwereru na mtswanowe kala ni dza vipande vya mkpwahe uriotiywa asali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa achigomba na Aiziraeli achiamba, “Mwenyezi Mlungu akalagiza kukala huike pishi mwenga ya mana huyiikire vivyazi vyedzavyo, ili edze aone chakurya hurichohewa ni Mlungu hiko jangbwani hipho ariphohutuluza kula Misiri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aeburania 9:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, Musa wamuamba Aruni, “Hala nyungu na utiye pishi mwenga ya manna, na uyiike mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu ikale kumbukumbu kpwa vivyazi vyedzavyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, Aruni wahala manna achiyiika, dza Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyomlagiza Musa. Badaye achiitiya ndani ya Sanduku ra Ushaidi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:34",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sanduku ra Ushaidi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ni sanduku malumu ambaro Mlungu waambira Aiziraeli ariike ndani ya hema ra mkpwutano, kala rina vitu vya kuatambukiza kutivywa kpwao kula Misiri na chilagane chao na Mlungu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ili ikale indaikpwato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
